OL,3,ALindsay Clancy's ex-husband says he
OL,4,Aforgave her so he would not be 'eaten
OL,5,Aup inside forever'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains
OL,8,Fdistressing details and discussion of
OL,9,Fattempted suicide
OL,11,FPatrick Clancy, the ex-husband of a US
OL,12,Fmother accused of murdering their three
OL,13,Fchildren, has said he would have been
OL,14,F"eaten up inside forever" had he not
OL,15,Fforgiven her for their deaths.
OL,17,FIn an interview with CBS, he also said
OL,18,Fhe did the best he could as his
OL,19,Fthen-wife Lindsay Clancy struggled with
OL,20,Fmental illness in the months leading up
OL,21,Fto the day she strangled their
OL,22,Fchildren.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
